Using the experimental parameters of Ref. [1], this value
is scaled by the factor 4τ 2 ∆2 /h̄2 ∼ 6 × 10−5 compared
to the maximum transient amplitude Eq. (7). In other
words, the probability that an electron is actually excited from the valence band into the conduction band
